<p>Peru’s Congress has selected legislator José María Balcázar as interim president, filling the vacancy after lawmakers removed interim leader José Jerí over corruption-related allegations. Several outlets describe Balcázar, a lawyer and former judge, as 83 years old. Balcázar is expected to serve in a caretaker role until Peru’s general election in April.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/5zXUmnYv3XUw-Dxbt5Jm1rz-8r-8WInY0SRE2ZAf-aHvrGugx5gO8MqAbgUJTf3LL6XMak1mnTvGIFkjtufRUhXjwtTNy7TEAZiqsKAy7_zxNfe6oS7E5rPLnAuwoalhCV7BHVvhvHTRVG_H_PUT9n8FPCtk3U4PA8xdAZhqrg' alt='Peru’s Congress voted to install José María Balcázar as interim president after José Jerí’s removal.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Two-round vote: Congress took two rounds to settle on Balcázar, heading into a runoff to choose the congressional leader who automatically becomes president.</li><li>Influence-peddling claims: Accounts of Jerí’s removal center on allegations of undisclosed meetings and suspected influence peddling, with Mercopress also citing alleged links to Chinese businessmen.</li><li>Caretaker timeframe: Mercopress says Balcázar will stay in office until July 28, when he must hand power to the winner of the April 12 general election.</li><li>Fast-moving politics: With Balcázar’s selection, Peru has had eight leaders since 2016, according to multiple outlets covering the latest turnover.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>South China Morning Post: SCMP noted the vote was broadcast live on television and described Balcázar as a left-wing lawmaker, as well as an 83-year-old lawyer and former judge. (<a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/americas/article/3343987/peru-congress-picks-countrys-eighth-president-decade'>South China Morning Post</a>)</li><li>Mercopress reporting: Mercopress focused on undisclosed meetings and suspected influence peddling in its account of Jerí’s removal, and also reported allegations of suspicious links to Chinese businessmen as Congress moved to a runoff to pick his successor. (<a href='https://en.mercopress.com/2026/02/19/peru-s-congress-heads-to-runoff-vote-to-pick-jose-jeri-s-successor'>MercoPress</a>)</li><li>Al Jazeera reporting: Al Jazeera described Balcázar as Peru’s ninth leader in a decade, while emphasizing that he is filling the role on an interim basis until the next elected executive takes office. (<a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/2/19/peru-appoints-new-president-after-jose-jeris-removal'>Al Jazeera</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/peru-installs-jose-balcazar-as-interim-president-after-jeri-ousted-in-political-upheaval'>Peru installs Jose Balcazar as interim president after Jeri ousted in political upheaval</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/lawmakers-elect-perus-president-after-latest-ouster-130268218'>Peru&#x27;s congress elects country&#x27;s eighth president in a decade</a> - abcnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.npr.org/2026/02/19/g-s1-110679/peru-new-president'>José María Balcázar becomes Peru&#x27;s eighth president in a decade</a> - npr.org</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/americas/article/3343987/peru-congress-picks-countrys-eighth-president-decade'>Peru Congress picks country’s eighth president in a decade</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/2/19/peru-appoints-new-president-after-jose-jeris-removal'>Peru appoints Jose Maria Balcazar as president, ninth leader in a decade</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://en.mercopress.com/2026/02/19/peru-s-congress-names-jose-maria-balcazar-interim-president'>Peru&#x27;s congress names José María Balcázar interim president</a> - mercopress.com</li><li><a href='https://apnews.com/article/peru-president-congress-interim-election-c6f1e2d6c061ea8ba1cb0f4f467609bc'>Following two rounds of voting, José María Balcázar succeeds the removed José Jerí as interim President of Peru.</a> - apnews.com</li></ul>